{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "おはようございます\nこんにちは\nこんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 菅原咲月（すがわらさつき）です🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/moborXx67.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "東京パソコンクラブ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "出演させていただいてます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆるふわお団子好評でとても嬉しい！😳💘\nなかなかおだんごやらないからね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もしかしたら初期スタ誕以来かもしれません😮"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見逃し配信もございますよ〜\nhttps://tver.jp/episodes/eplo9gxzjn"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゲームと触れ合う機会があまりなかったのですが、楽しすぎて購入を検討しています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと、見逃し配信観る時の注意\nわたしの声が終始大きいので気を付けてね！笑\n騒ぎすぎたぜ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来週もお邪魔しますので是非！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "東京パソコンクラブ\nテレビ東京系  毎週金曜26時〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミート&グリート\nありがとうございました！🪽"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobJn7LJj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mob5RDpNw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵なお花もありがとう！💐\nお花畑だ〜！！幸せです🫣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mob9zbnqC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "つん。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "制服もきたよ〜〜👔\nひなが誘ってくれました🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちゃっかり、TikTokも撮ってみたり。\n高校生気分を味わいました〜\n楽しかった😽"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみにこの日色んな種類の靴下持っていったんだけど、ひーつんにどれがいいかな〜って相談したらこれで！！ってルーズソックス選んでくれた🫶🏻\nつんちゃんに感謝"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/moblBV00d.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂でしか味わえない青春だね\nいつもありがと☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46\n43rdシングル「君ロス」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "12/2 に発売することが決定いたしました！\nありがとうございます🙇🏻‍♀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今後、様々な情報が解禁されていくと思います\n週刊乃木坂ニュースでも随時お届けしていきますのでこちらも是非チェックしてみてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/tvzMgHhvi1A 👓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "では、また書きます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日の一曲。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "帰り道は遠回りしたくなる / 乃木坂46"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分の気持ちが揺らいでしまいそうになった時\n気持ちを強くもっていたいけど頑張れないかもしれないと思う時には今でもりりあさんが掛けてくださった言葉を思い出しています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大切です😌\n最後まで笑顔でお見送りしなきゃね、、！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026.10.17"}], "source": "official"}